# Sample audit logs and state, where the samples write them (repository root or the sample's folder). Anchored on
# purpose: on Windows and macOS Git ignores case, so a bare "data/" would also hide source folders such as
# src/Homeostat/Data/.
/logs/
/data/
/samples/*/logs/
/samples/*/data/

